 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "how to fit a tele knox shaft and arm cup to a minelab equinox"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The tele-knox folding handle for the Minelab Equinox is also available for the minelab Vanquish and other metal detectors with the correct shaft size."
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/tele-knox_weba.jpg\" alt=\"minelab equinox tele knox shaft fitting guide\" title=\"minelab equinox tele knox shaft fitting guide\" width=\"239\" height=\"134\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The folding Tele-Knox handle allows it to fold down into the arm cup and this makes the equinox more suitable for transporting, if you have one of the tele-knox telescopic detector shafts then this will allow the detector to fold down to around 22 inch."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "also fitting of the upgraded Tele-Knox aluminium arm cup, if you have suffered from broken armcups or just fancy a cool accessory for your detector then one of these Tele-knox products are a practical must."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Fitting of both the tele-know arm cup and folding equinox handle takes around 10-15 minutes"
  }
 ],
